{"id":"wb-7-1152","name":"大汶口古石桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大汶口古石桥","text":"大汶口古石桥位于中国山东省泰安市岱岳区大汶口镇西南大汶河上，2006年被列为山东省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，分类为古建筑。\n大汶口古石桥始建于明隆庆年间，北起大汶口镇西南门，南至宁阳县茶棚村，横跨大汶河，全长570.95米，是一座石板桥，桥板每块长3.5米，宽52公分，桥面用五块石板连成。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B1%B6%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A4%E7%9F%B3%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":91966262,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91966262","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/490fbaefbe61534dea331a5a.jpg","title":"大汶口古石桥龙头.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E6%B1%B6%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A4%E7%9F%B3%E6%A1%A5%E9%BE%99%E5%A4%B4.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B1%B6%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A4%E7%9F%B3%E6%A1%A5%E9%BE%99%E5%A4%B4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cuiruozhihai","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​双龙头，位于大汶口明石桥中部。大汶口明石桥是国家重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":240}}